==Battleground==
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 11.67 seconds<sup>350f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Balrog (Enemy)|Balrog]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

